{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>AirGuard 將空氣品質數據、山火資訊與煙霧分析整理成易讀答案，適合關注戶外活動、附近山火與空氣變化的人士使用；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-62.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>空氣山火資訊一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>AirGuard 以大型 AQI 讀數配合通俗摘要、主要汙染物及戶外活動指引，並註明不構成醫療診斷；同時顯示已確認山火事件與範圍、煙霧羽流地圖，衛星火點則標示為參考資訊。它提供 24 小時空氣品質預報及可選本地警報，涵蓋 AQI 門檻、附近新增山火、煙霧出現或每日摘要；離線快取讀數會標示為「Offline data」。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-18-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-19-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-20-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-21-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-22-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-23-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：AirGuard: Air Quality &amp; Fires</li><li>應用類別：Weather</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/airguard-air-quality-fires/id6808870873?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:05:37.522023+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:39:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:53.537389+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:45.779140+00:00","content_hash":"706152476d8a2b3313b81af112c8a70841a3dc5b2c0de5c5d17cfbfb7988a5d3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}